<div class="rounded border border-gray-200 bg-white text-xs text-gray-600 mt-3" data-testid="scope-box-ask_a_work">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5">
<p class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate" title="Every passage in one work whose content matches a subject you describe, listed by how well it matches, with a strip showing where in the work they fall.">
<span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">What this search does.</span> Every passage in one work whose content matches a subject you describe, listed by how well it matches, with a strip showing where in the work they fall.</p>
<button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="scope-panel-ask_a_work" class="shrink-0 text-red-700 hover:underline">Details</button>
</div>
</div>
<form class="mt-4 space-y-3">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2">
<select aria-label="Language" class="w-full border rounded px-2 py-2 text-base sm:text-sm">
<option value="la">Latin</option>
<option value="grc">Greek</option>
<option value="en">English</option>
<option value="he">Hebrew</option>
