<main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 py-4 sm:py-6">
<div class="space-y-6">
<div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Downloads</h2>
<p class="text-gray-600">Download the Tesserae corpus texts and pre-computed embeddings for offline analysis.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
<div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Corpus Texts</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Download all texts in .tess format for a language. Texts are organized by author and work. Persian and Urdu texts are searchable on the site but are not offered as ZIP files pending their sources' terms. The Urdu search index, which holds the line text of fourteen Wikisource collections, is offered under the developer data files below.</p>
<div class="space-y-3">
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded">
<div>
<span class="font-medium">Latin</span>
<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 ml-2">(about 1,830 texts)</span>
</div>
<button class="px-4 py-2 bg-red-700 text-white rounded hover:bg-red-800 disabled:opacity-50 text-sm">Download ZIP</button>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded">
<div>
<span class="font-medium">Greek</span>
<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 ml-2">(about 1,330 texts)</span>
</div>
<button class="px-4 py-2 bg-red-700 text-white rounded hover:bg-red-800 disabled:opacity-50 text-sm">Download ZIP</button>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded">
<div>
<span class="font-medium">English</span>
<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 ml-2">(about 160 texts)</span>
</div>
<button class="px-4 py-2 bg-red-700 text-white rounded hover:bg-red-800 disabled:opacity-50 text-sm">Download ZIP</button>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded">
<div>
<span class="font-medium">Coptic</span>
<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 ml-2">(about 160, without the Sahidica New Testament texts)</span>
</div>
<button class="px-4 py-2 bg-red-700 text-white rounded hover:bg-red-800 disabled:opacity-50 text-sm">Download ZIP</button>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded">
<div>
<span class="font-medium">Hebrew</span>
<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 ml-2">(about 40 texts)</span>
</div>
<button class="px-4 py-2 bg-red-700 text-white rounded hover:bg-red-800 disabled:opacity-50 text-sm">Download ZIP</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Semantic Embeddings</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Pre-computed line embeddings for semantic search, made with SPhilBERTa for Latin and Greek. One .npy array plus a .meta.json of line references per text.</p>
<div class="space-y-3">
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded">
<div>
<span class="font-medium">Latin</span>
<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 ml-2">(embeddings)</span>
</div>
<button class="px-4 py-2 bg-amber-600 text-white rounded hover:bg-amber-700 disabled:opacity-50 text-sm">Download ZIP</button>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded">
<div>
<span class="font-medium">Greek</span>
<span class="text-sm text-gray-500 ml-2">(embeddings)</span>
</div>
<button class="px-4 py-2 bg-amber-600 text-white rounded hover:bg-amber-700 disabled:opacity-50 text-sm">Download ZIP</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow p-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Benchmark Sets</h3>
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-2">Original Tesserae datasets on this page are released under CC BY 4.0: free to use and redistribute with attribution to the Tesserae Project.</p>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Hand-curated datasets for evaluating intertextual detection algorithms. Includes hand-ranked parallels from scholarly commentaries (Hunter, Knauer, Neils) and Tesserae results with scoring.</p>
<div class="space-y-4">
<div>
<h4 class="font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2">Latin to Latin</h4>
<div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
<div class="p-2 bg-gray-50 rounded">
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
<div>
<span class="font-medium">Lucan BC 1 vs Vergil Aeneid - Benchmark 1</span>
<span class="text-gray-500 ml-2">(hand-ranked)</span>
