</div>
<a href="/static/downloads/benchmarks/Stat.Achilleid1.benchmark.xlsx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-3 py-1 bg-red-700 text-white rounded hover:bg-red-800 text-xs self-start sm:self-auto whitespace-nowrap">XLSX</a>
