</div>
</div>
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Dexter et al. (2023). References to Vergil, Ovid, Lucan, and Statius from Kleywegt, Spaltenstein, and Zissos commentaries. <a href="https://openhumanitiesdata.metajnl.com/articles/10.5334/johd.153" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-red-600 hover:underline">Article</a> | <a href="https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/S6RD4M" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-red-600 hover:underline">Full Dataset</a>
