<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Coptic Text-Reuse Study</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Complete evaluation data for the article “Multi-Channel Feature Fusion for Finding Coptic Text Reuse”: gold-standard benchmarks, ranked search outputs, weight-optimization logs, and the scripts that reproduce them. Because the Sahidica New Testament is licensed for academic use only, its line text is replaced with verse references throughout; every result is reproducible with the freely obtainable Sahidica text. See the README for the full inventory and licensing.</p>
