<li>Baraz, Yelena, and Christopher van den Berg. 2013. "Introduction" to special issue on Intertextuality. <em>American Journal of Philology</em> 134: p. 4 n. 22.</li>
</ul>
</section>
<section>
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">V3 Blog Archive</h3>
<p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">Scholarly posts from the legacy Tesserae V3 website (2019–2021) have been preserved. <button class="text-amber-600 hover:underline font-medium">View archived blog posts</button>
