<button class="text-xs text-red-700 hover:text-red-900 hover:bg-red-50 border border-gray-200 rounded px-2 py-1">funeral games with athletic contests held in honor of the dead</button>
<button class="text-xs text-red-700 hover:text-red-900 hover:bg-red-50 border border-gray-200 rounded px-2 py-1">a storm at sea batters ships and terrifies the crew</button>
</div>
</div>
</main>
<footer class="bg-gray-100 border-t mt-8 py-4">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center text-sm text-gray-500">
